<description>&lt;p&gt;Deadly earthquakes have devastated parts of Venezuela, collapsing buildings and prompting humanitarian aid. The United States has lifted sanctions on the leader of Venezuela's National Assembly and deployed Space Force electromagnetic and electronic warfare systems against the country. President Nicolás Maduro and his wife face a delayed U.S. torture conspiracy trial scheduled for 2027. A Dutch security report warns that Venezuela's instability could threaten Curaçao and the wider Caribbean Kingdom. Two battle-related deaths were recorded in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOazVXTHFxejQ1NGRjNmF4a2ZxYUZVanJFamJka3VkTVdSLVowRDQ0dHpfZDlfNXhJaWR5VThaWVN3bkw3TVJ2QU1JQU1OMFdKM1RrdzRNbzlZeUtJUC1fcnUxZ2QxVnBtU19JVTcyeGR5R3Jhb2NQTHVPQ0d4QWlRblVmSlRxWnJBb2V3UXZuWFRHV0JyWTR5YW41RTBRYmp4LWpRX0ljbmFyU28?oc=5&quot;&gt;Trinidad Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxPSThkVlA4a1BiZmExS0k4djM2cmEwaXliX2k5eUFnLU9qM2x6X0llMkU5QjhiNWxZLVI0SzF6Ykc5aEVVTTFydjF4MzgtVHJPRU10V2tFM0prSWRDVWJiU2pUaFNlLWo0eGd3dmtwNjFZYk1HLUVreW1rMzhKUDZ2Wm9FNzFFVnZGVE51REU1aWY?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxOU0VYTGZPd2RmZlZvZWJBZmRHbEsxWFdtYXF3b1ZJVU9FZmRncmoxSERRWldzS0Z0TTJsbVRoLThDT2FfZi1XVHB2QkhmemJGX0M2S3RsUVBTSnN1engtaURsamc3TGxRa0E2RmpVaEJOdVFCQlVhaDJWaG5qQzVCNkRYckxRMmdOZElvLU1zZjROb1p2X1AxYUVB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxNMWpya25lX28tcGJpZ0MxbzZHWXFUNko5a1puYi1lZTFvOXBET1NjTHRoR0xKaVJYN0JJd0tCOWJ2U3pWR0lNVGpmbFBRRW8xUFluaWhoUnM5Qm56dlM5dWVTQVdXZzZiNlFod0oxQk1Bb1RIZjhmaWJFaFBvdzh1TWdlenBNcGxfWlVKLTNZa3JYUVhnU